  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Whose record is it?",
      "items": [
        "Every main-agent usage record is either the keep-warm ping's or the user's. attributeUsage decides from the ping flags and from who started the turn.",
        "On a host that sends no user.message, the first record during a ping flight goes to the ping, even if you typed meanwhile. Your own turn is then booked as a call once the ping is answered or given up on.",
        "A ping's record refreshes the cache expiry but is not a model call in the tally. The report shows it as keep-warm spend.",
        "On resume the same split runs over the log: the first main record after a ping message, before any later user message, is the ping's (createPingLedger)."
      ]
    }
  ]
